   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"11\">\n  <li>Mariah has data in a table. Plot the data. Which inequality in two variables represents these ordered pairs as solutions?</li>\n</ol>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"x\">x</span></th>\n      <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"y\">y</span></th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>−4</td>\n      <td>7</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>−2</td>\n      <td>3</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>0</td>\n      <td>-1</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>-5</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
   "answers": [
    {
